      "schema:comment": "Known issue reported by the source for this measurement: Cell failed at the end of 1st cycle. The test record that produced this file states it as a conformance deviation (status non-conformant, category premature_termination); it is repeated here so the warning travels with the data rather than only with the test. The protocol specifies 5 cycles and this run did not finish them, so the file holds fewer cycles than the protocol describes."
    },
